              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la pratica — \"the paperwork, the case (being handled); the practice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La mia pratica è ancora in comune. My paperwork is still at the town hall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In pratica — in practice, basically. Fare pratica — to get experience."
            }
          ]
        },
