          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pratica is a learned borrowing from Late Latin practica, related to practicus \"active\" (Lewis & Short), from Greek praktikḗ \"practical knowledge\", from prássein \"to do, to act\"; the office sense is a matter being dealt with."
